<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins $1.00-4.00 higher; butts steady to 1.00 higher; skinned hams steady to weak; seedless bellies steady; lean trimmings 3.00 higher.</p>
<p>Trading slow to moderate, with light to moderate demand and light offerings.-- USDA</p>
